     "field": "smtp.req.command",
     "value": "EHLO"
    },
    {
     "packet": 8,
     "field": "smtp.response.code",
     "value": "220"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "EHLO→STARTTLS→220台词；tshark把STARTTLS命令截断显示为STAR（伪影），不断言该包原文，只断包序+220响应；真升级另立项；离线TestSMTP_2_6_1转pcap"
   ]
